From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jung-Kang Lee <ntoskrnl7@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Mar 2026 07:18:22 +0900
Subject: fix: enable hardware video encode/decode on NVIDIA X11 ANGLE GL-EGL

- use SkiaOutputDeviceX11 for the X11 ANGLE OpenGL output path
- choose EGL configs that match the actual X11 window visual/depth
- preserve NV12/P010 native pixmap import capability after recomputing gpu feature info
- enable NVIDIA VAAPI/native pixmap paths needed by the media pipeline

